// f_tf_hatch -- stroke-texture PRE-STAGE, V pass (2026-10-30).
// Spec: tests/modules/tf_hatch/tf_hatch_mirror.py `stage_prefilter` (this is its second loop).
//
// Takes the H pass's output (ow x render height) down to ow x oh: each output texel is the mean of four nearest
// taps spread evenly across it vertically, as offsets from `norm` in units of the OUTPUT texel (1/oh), so no
// source size is needed. `oh` = max(1, render height // 4), driven by Vsynth through render_dim `downsample`.
// The result is what E2 reads as its stroke texture (Grain tiles it, Density thresholds its luma).
//
// in1: the H pass's output.   out1: the reduced stroke texture.

Param oh(64);

ih = 1.0 / max(oh, 1.0);

acc = nearest(in1, vec(norm.x, norm.y - 0.375 * ih));
acc = acc + nearest(in1, vec(norm.x, norm.y - 0.125 * ih));
acc = acc + nearest(in1, vec(norm.x, norm.y + 0.125 * ih));
acc = acc + nearest(in1, vec(norm.x, norm.y + 0.375 * ih));

out1 = acc * 0.25;
